  SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

  Exposes lge-telephony-extras as a system-shared Java library so callers
  not on the bootclasspath can still link against it via <uses-library>.
  Currently no apps in our blob set actually need this XML (Ims6 picks
  the classes up from PRODUCT_SYSTEM_EXT_BOOT_JARS), but shipping it now
  keeps future RCS / phone-app additions ready.
-->
<permissions>
    <library name="lge-telephony-extras"
             file="/system_ext/framework/lge-telephony-extras.jar"/>
</permissions>
